孟增幸於周成王，是為宅皋狼。皋狼生衡父，衡父生造父。造父以善御幸於周繆王，得驥、溫驪、驊騮、騄耳之駟，西巡狩，樂而忘歸。徐偃王作亂，造父為繆王御，長驅歸周，一日千里以救亂。繆王以趙城封造父，造父族由此為趙氏。自蜚廉生季勝已下五世至造父，別居趙。趙衰其後也。惡來革者，蜚廉子也，蚤死。有子曰女防。女防生旁皋，旁皋生太幾，太幾生大駱，大駱生非子。以造父之寵，皆蒙趙城，姓趙氏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"其玄孫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或未核定指代；未由熟知世系補造人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"中潏","kind":"person","person_id":"yeo_6mv_tut","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"蜚廉","kind":"person","person_id":"8gd_zz1_8a3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"蜚廉","kind":"person","person_id":"8gd_zz1_8a3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"惡來","kind":"person","person_id":"9rl_u52_5fz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"惡來","kind":"person","person_id":"9rl_u52_5fz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"蜚廉","kind":"person","person_id":"8gd_zz1_8a3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"殷紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"周武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"惡來","kind":"person","person_id":"9rl_u52_5fz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"蜚廉","kind":"person","person_id":"8gd_zz1_8a3","status":"contextu